        ("M36 an ANCESTOR shard (S220) deleted from the working tree", before, after, shard,
         claude, None, SAME, reach, m36, provenance),
        ("M37 an ANCESTOR shard (S224) edited by one character on disk", before, after, shard,
         claude, None, SAME, reach, m37, provenance),
        ("M38 every copy AND the declaration leave Session 224 unrouted (GAP)", before, m38_a,
         m38_s, m38_c, {"POINTER": m38_p, "BANNER": m38_b, "ROUTING": m38_r}, SAME, reach, lineage, provenance),
        ("M39 every copy AND the declaration route Session 225 to two files (OVERLAP)", before,
         m39_a, m39_s, m39_c, {"POINTER": m39_p, "BANNER": m39_b, "ROUTING": m39_r}, SAME, reach, lineage, provenance),
        ("M40 substitution 2's anchor absent from `before` (declaration gone stale)",
         before.replace(FRONT_SUBST[1][0], "REPLACED BY AN EARLIER EDIT\n", 1), after, shard,
         claude, None, SAME, reach, lineage, provenance),
        ("M41 BACKLOG.md's read-cap item still says 'four unwatched shards'", before, after,
         shard, claude, None, SAME, m41, lineage, provenance),
        ("M42 BACKLOG.md's read-cap item never names the new shard", before, after, shard,
         claude, None, SAME, m42, lineage, provenance),
        ("M43 CLAUDE.md: six correct routing clauses, count words still saying four", before,
         after, shard, claude, None, SAME, m43, lineage, provenance),
        ("M44 PROJECT_CONVENTIONS.md: the falsified count restored BESIDE the correct one", before,
         after, shard, claude, None, SAME, m44, lineage, provenance),
        ("M45 PROJECT_CONVENTIONS.md: an ANCESTOR shard's filename typo'd", before, after, shard,
